  str_n23_level_name_12 = "N10 - Truth",
  str_n23_level_name_13 = "N11 - Desperation",
  str_n23_level_name_14 = "N12 - Emergence",
  str_n23_level_name_15 = "ST3 - Idle Banter",
  str_n23_level_desc_1 = "-",
  str_n23_level_desc_2 = "You and Vice reach the Andersen Haunted House and discover that its owner is a familiar face.",
  str_n23_level_desc_3 = "In one of the corridors, you encounter horror film director Jonny and his crew. You soon discover Minos' other identity...",
  str_n23_level_desc_4 = "Sadie breaks away from Jonny and catches up to you, bringing the crew's location chart along with her.",
  str_n23_level_desc_5 = "A mysterious, masked figure leading a horde of Eclipsites chases after you. Something about all of this is very strange...",
  str_n23_level_desc_6 = "A dark room, creepy puppets, and the sound of water dripping... Someone must have designed this intentionally... right?",
  str_n23_level_desc_7 = "As your heart is still palpitating from fear, a steel claw reaches out towards you, trying to tell you something...",
  str_n23_level_desc_8 = "-",
  str_n23_level_desc_9 = "You mull over everything that has happened so far. You conclude that... Wait, is someone outside?",
  str_n23_level_desc_10 = "You are drawing closer and closer to the truth! Dispatch these enemies before they disrupt your deducing!",
  str_n23_level_desc_11 = "You and your companions are furious at the events that have unfolded tonight. Someone must be held accountable for everything, including the Eclipsites standing before you.",
  str_n23_level_desc_12 = "Run, escape. And whatever you do... don't look back.",
  str_n23_level_desc_13 = "Hurry! Take out the rest of the Eclipsites blocking your way! Wait... Where are Lilica and Sadie?",
  str_n23_level_desc_14 = "That which you fear, the thing you dare not face, now stands before you. There is no other choice but to fight now.",
  str_n23_level_desc_15 = "-",
  str_n23_level_desc_long_1 = "Umbraton's newspaper headline details an unknown actress going missing during the filming of a horror movie and catches your undivided attention. Meanwhile, Vice has fixated on the grand opening of Andersen Haunted House, which claims to have \"real paranormal phenomena.\" She invites you to the haunted house, but you can't get your mind off the disappearance.",
  str_n23_level_desc_long_2 = "As expected, this mansion belongs to Nina Andersen. Minos follows Nina's instructions to guide you and Vice through the premises. Inside, you meet Lilica, a fellow enthusiast of the paranormal. She greets you with enthusiasm and seems to want to document this adventure and turn it into a movie.",
  str_n23_level_desc_long_3 = "You meet the director in the case of the disappearing actress. He already has plans for a new movie and introduces you to two actresses, Goldie and Sadie. You learn from the conversation that Nina and Minos are not on the same page since Jonny wants to film long-term in the mansion. Minos is stuck in the middle and is temporarily serving as an interim producer.",
  str_n23_level_desc_long_4 = "Following Sadie's location chart and Minos' lead, you reach the bedroom, the first shooting location. You find an old television with a creepy image on the screen. A brief conversation with the masked fellow indicates that you may not leave the haunted house alive.",
  str_n23_level_desc_long_5 = "Blowing the quiz, you have no choice but to fight the masked fellow and the Eclipsites, but the masked fellow calls off the attack. It turns out Nina is under the mask, and the Eclipsites are actually friends in costumes. Nina is proud of her staged \"attraction.\" Paranormal lover Lilica takes the disappointed Vice and the rest to the next filming location.",
  str_n23_level_desc_long_6 = "The second location is the showroom. The damp air and spooky puppets are a constant reminder that the house is haunted. Shabby singing and the noise of dripping water start to reverberate around the area. But as Sadie scoffs at the cheap parlor tricks, the dripping water seems to prove her wrong.",
  str_n23_level_desc_long_7 = "Outside the showroom, you run into Mia, who came here alone. She seems to enjoy touring by herself, and before parting, she cryptically passes on a warning that is perhaps coherent only to herself: Watch out and don't let \"her\" catch you.",
  str_n23_level_desc_long_8 = "You follow Minos to the final location—the basement, where you notice various peculiar clues implying that the former owner had been punishing young children. Moreover, there is a film crew log nearby with unsettling content. Suddenly, the basement goes dark, and you witness scary sights through the night scope on the camera... \nBut it turns out to be nothing; you were paranoid for no reason.",
  str_n23_level_desc_long_9 = "After checking out all the filming locations, Minos leads you back to the office to sort out clues. You agree that the crew's motive behind the actress's disappearance is the key. But a second later, Eclipsites besiege the office...",
  str_n23_level_desc_long_10 = "Having disposed of the Eclipsites, you return to the office. Minos rummages through files to seek more clues. Lilica brings back developed photos to show everyone, only to make the shocking discovery that there's an arm in there that doesn't belong to anyone in the room.",
  str_n23_level_desc_long_11 = "Lilica reveals her true identity as the missing female lead of Jonny's previous film mentioned in the news. Connecting the dots, you figure out Jonny is making horror flicks using Eclipsites, and decide to confront him. Shockingly, Jonny is even more diabolical than you anticipated and kills Goldie before turning his attention to the rest of you...",
  str_n23_level_desc_long_12 = "The director tells you that he murdered every member of his previous crew except Lilica, who escaped. Now that you know the truth, you are next. Lilica spots a strange woman approaching through her camera, but no one cares. They're too busy running.",
  str_n23_level_desc_long_13 = "The fight ends with Lilica and Sadie separating from the party and hiding in a small room together. Jonny bludgeons the door with an axe until it splinters, closing in on the screaming ladies. Just as things are about to take a turn for the worst, Jonny hears others calling. Then he suddenly turns and leaves...",
  str_n23_level_desc_long_14 = "A coffin blocks your path. Spine-tingling noises from inside the coffin stop anyone from approaching. Jonny appears behind you and starts filming for the movie's climax. A horrifying monster crawls out of the coffin and there's nowhere for you to run... Fortunately, Lilica and Sadie arrive on the scene to fight the monster. Finally, with help from the Aurorians in the haunted house, you slay the monster. That pathetic director wants to feed himself to the monster, only for Goldie to emerge, still alive, and put an end to the farce.",
  str_n23_level_desc_long_15 = [[
The whole thing ends with Istvan's people taking Jonny away, Lilica's tape going gangbusters, and the Andersen Haunted House benefitting from the newfound fame. You return days later for a reunion, with Lilica, Sadie, and Goldie touting new aspirations. 
But the faint sound of water dripping is suddenly heard in the distance...]]
}
